Licensing

Plasmonk is not distributed under a single license.

Plasmonk's own scripts and configuration (for example install.sh,
uninstall.sh, bin/, lib/, tools/, systemd/ and presets.conf) are released
under the MIT License, reproduced below.

The theme assets and templates in themes/ are derived from third-party
projects and keep their upstream licenses, which include MIT, GPL-3.0 and
LGPL. See CREDITS.md for the per-file mapping and licenses/ for the full
texts.

Because the repository combines these licenses, GitHub's license detector
reports it as "Other" rather than as a single SPDX license.

